"cu jetnu"

(Not sure properties can be said to be jetnu or not jetnu though.)

> mi cpacu lo ka tsali lo ka baldjica .i je mi cpacu lo ka vlipa lo ka
> tsali .i je mi cpacu lo ka jinga lo ka vlipa .i

There you need some KEIs. Perhaps without the KEIs it still makes some
sense, though probably not exactly what you meant:

"tsali lo ka baldjica" is "strong in passion" (if "baldjica" is "passion").
"vlipa lo ka tsali" is "powerful to be strong".
"jinga lo ka vlipa" is "beat power".

You can say "mi cpacu lo ka tsali kei lo ka baldji" or you to avoid
the KEI you could say "mi cpacu lo kamtsa lo kambaldji"

